    *   where σ_link^(h-,h)(t) is the link shaping curve for flow f at node h, C is the link rate, and l_Mi^(h-,h,max) is the maximum frame size of flow f at node h-.
*   CBS shaping curve:
    *   σ_Mi^(h-,h)(t) = idleSlope_Mi * t + (c_Mi^(h-,max) - c_Mi^(h-,min)) + l_Mi^(h-,h,max)
